## Not canonical

Do not use root `notebooks/` as reference architecture. Domain packages live under `investing/src/investing/` and `credit/src/credit/`.

## Code changes

Investing implementation changes must trace to a feature spec under `investing/docs/features/` or the demo slice. Credit changes must trace to specs under `credit/docs/` (create the spec first). Read `CONTEXT-MAP.md` and the matching domain CONTEXT before proposing design or code.
